.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
list \- List items, optionally filtered by status and/or type. Id\-ordered by default (so the `\-\-json` record stays plugin\-independent); override with `\-\-sort rank`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlist\fR [\fB\-\-status\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List items, optionally filtered by status and/or type. Id\-ordered by default (so the `\-\-json` record stays plugin\-independent); override with `\-\-sort rank`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-status\fR \fI<STATUS>\fR
Filter by status
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<TY>\fR
Filter by type, using the active plugin\*(Aqs vocabulary (see `nxf schema`)
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<LABEL>\fR
Filter to items carrying this label (user vocabulary, not the display type)
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Sort order: `rank` | `id` (default `id`). An unknown key is a loud error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
